N1  - <p>BOINC criterion evidence - Abstract, verbatim: "This article addresses the joint usage of RapidMiner and BOINC. We describe the integration of both tools and present some of the research accomplishments of the distributedDataMining.org project." Introduction, verbatim: "We describe the usage of the BOINC framework and the distribution of research related computing tasks to thousands of heterogeneous computing nodes located all over the world. Each of these nodes uses the BOINC client to pull computing tasks and data packages from a central server." Section 2.2, verbatim: "The Berkeley Open Infrastructure for Network Computing (BOINC) is a software framework for distributed and grid computing." Section 2.4: "We implemented a module which allows Drupal to interact with the BOINC framework." Section 2.4: "BOINC provides a C++ library which enables a given scientific application to communicate with the BOINC client." | Full text: RCOMM 2013, Porto, Portugal | Link: DistributedDataMining / BOINC | Source: RCOMM 2013 (2013)ER&nbsp;&nbsp;-</p>
